This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-flatsat2-bsp layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
  layers: meta, meta-poky
  branch: langdale

  URI: https://git.openembedded.org/meta-openembedded
  layers: meta-oe
  branch: langdale

  URI: https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-xilinx.git
  layers: meta-xilinx-core
  branch: rel-v2023.1

  URI: https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-xilinx-tools.git
  layers: meta-xilinx-tools
  branch: rel-v2023.1
  
Patches
=======

Please submit any patches against the meta-flatsat2 layer to the github repository
and cc: the maintainer:

Maintainer: Carlos Freitas <carlos.porto@spacelab.ufsc.br>

Table of Contents
